{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45487","headline":"夜直 · 子兰","name":"夜直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大内隔重墙，多闻乐未央。\n灯明宫树色，茶煮禁泉香。\n凤辇通门静，鸡歌入漏长。\n宴荣陪御席，话密近龙章。\n吟步彤庭月，眠分玉暑凉。\n欲粘朱绂重，频草白麻忙。\n笔力将羣吏，人情在致唐。\n万方瞻仰处，晨夕面吾皇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"子兰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45487.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45487","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}